# This repository serves a website and the desktop update feed.
#
# The site ships fonts, PNG/WebP companion artwork and icon containers. A line-ending
# conversion applied to any of those corrupts the file, so the binary types are named
# explicitly rather than left to Git's content sniffing.
#
# Normalising text to LF also keeps the working tree deterministic, which is what stops
# every commit from reporting "LF will be replaced by CRLF".
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.apng  binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.ttf   binary
